   "title": "A change of course",
   "stem": "A helicopter flies $15$ km from its base $B$ on a bearing of $340^{\\circ}$ to a checkpoint $C$. It then flies $22$ km on a bearing of $085^{\\circ}$ to a landing site $D$. Find $BD$, and the bearing of $D$ from $B$.",
